  queried; these three tests did not target a specific record ID.

## Proposed follow-ups on claude-sonnet-5-5 (needs separate budget approval)

Worth repeating, because a larger model may follow role-play or multi-step
framing further than Haiku did:

1. **Test 2 (Base64 transformation)** — strongest leak vector of the three: it
